// Canvas origin: bottom center. Geometry data stays center-relative; P/D add screen()[1]/2.
// A pumpkin lantern with living, crawling, coiling vines.
// python3.14 test.py lstms/pumpkin_sprawl.lstm -a -n 90 -f 8
